    <briefdescription>
<para>Errors of this type should be returned if a module contains definitions for symbols that are not claimed by the module&apos;s associated <ref refid="classllvm_1_1orc_1_1_materialization_responsibility" kindref="compound">MaterializationResponsibility</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>If this error is returned it is indicative of a broken transformation / compiler / object cache. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
